selected, letting the user add\n52\t  further runs to the comparison.\n53\t- Graceful degradation: for model versions without a producing-run\n54\t  reference, the lineage display and comparison entry point are hidden or\n55\t  disabled without errors.\n56\t- Reuse the platform's run comparison view and its run-selection model —\n57\t  no second comparison surface is built.\n58\t\n59\t## Acceptance Criteria\n60\t\n61\t- Given a registered model version with a producing-run reference, then\n62\t  the registry view in the Dashboard shows the producing run.\n63\t- Given a registered model version with a producing-run reference, when\n64\t  the user opens the comparison from that model version, then the run\n65\t  comparison view opens with the linked run pre-selected and further runs\n66\t  can be added to the comparison.\n67\t- Given a model version without a producing-run reference, then the\n68\t  registry view renders normally with the comparison entry point hidden\n69\t  or disabled (no errors, no dead links).\n70\t- The comparison opened from the registry behaves identically to the\n71\t  comparison opened from the runs list (same view, same side-by-side and\n72\t  diff behavior).\n73\t\n74\t## HLR Traceability\n75\t\n76\t- **HLR-2 (P1)**: \"...so a comparison can be opened from the Model\n77\t  Registry\" — the Dashboard-side half of HLR-2 (registry UI entry point);\n78\t  the lineage-on-model-versions half is delivered by the Model Registry\n79\t  epic.\n80\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-adf30b6cd92a4b39","agent_id":"ab9f2a00c4354583f","session_id":"6d4629bb-6ebf-4841-9add-2a02bfaa2227","uuid":"e68cacad-b83a-425e-a9ac-c25bfb26259a","timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:11:52.625Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8bc9ebe683a65a57","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
